# Tessera stdlib: the correctly rounded sine and cosine of BF16 together
#
# sin(x) and cos(x) from one table lookup, as sin and cos compute them: for |x| < 4096 from the addition formulas
# over x = x1 + x2 (x1 keeps the exponent and the upper 4 bits of the mantissa, x2 the exponent and the lower 3 bits)
# and the tables in Sin.te, for |x| >= 4096 from tabulated sine and cosine of the powers of 2 that make up |x|. Each
# B32 result rounds once to BF16. Round to nearest only.
#
# Ported from CORE-MATH, src/binaryb16/sincos/sincos_bf16.c.
# Copyright (c) 2025 Paul Zimmermann
# MIT license: see LICENSE-CORE-MATH

module System/Numerics/BF16

